PUBLIC HEARING regarding a review and recommendation of the
Preliminary Development Plan for Cowboy Kids at Ridley Ranch.
24 - 331
PZ-24-00041 PC 6.27.24 Staff Packet
Attachments:
Cate Cundall, Associate Planner, said that AVI, PC, on behalf of Cowboy Kids Land
Co., LLC, amended their Preliminary Development Plan application for Cowboy Kids
at Ridley Ranch. The amended plan now includes 283.1 acres that contains 41
buildable tracts and 4 nonbuildable open space tracts. Three additional open space
lots were added and the gross acreage per tract increased to 6.25 acres. All open
space tracts will be held under common ownership and cannot be divided or
developed.
