PUBLIC HEARING regarding a Zone Change from AR-Agricultural
Residential to MU-Mixed Use for Tract 2, Church of Christ
Subdivision, 1st Filing, and Tract 2, Church of Christ, 2nd Filing,
Laramie County, WY.
24 - 321
PZ-24-00047 PC Meeting Packet 6.27.24
Attachments:
Commission Member John Watkins announced that he would be recusing himself
from this agenda item and exited the room.
Cate Cundall, Associate Planner, said that an application for a zone change was
received from Cheyenne Church of Christ and Airport Church of Christ for Tract 2,
Church of Christ Subdivision, 1st Filing and Tract 2, Church of Christ Subdivision, 2nd
Filing. The application was submitted to change the zone district from AR to MU to
accommodate commercial uses for these parcels.
Also submitted was an application for an Administrative Plat for Tract 1, Church of
Christ Subdivision, 1st Filing, Laramie County, WY. The purpose of the application is
to divide a 17.19 acre parcel into two tracts, to be known as Church of Christ
Subdivision, 2nd Filing. Tract 1 will be an 11.92 acre tract that includes the existing
church and Tract 2 will be 5.25 acres of vacant land that will be sold. The
Administrative Plat application will be approved by the Board of County
Commissioners.
