Planning Commission
Minutes of the Proceedings - Final
June 27, 2024
Chairman Caughey opened the public hearing and hearing no comments closed the
hearing and called for a motion and discussion.
John Watkins moved, seconded by Jack Stadel to approve a reduction in
the minimum required rear setback for Lot 10, Block 2, Terry Homesites,
Laramie County, WY with the condition that there is an exterior wall
modification for a fire wall on the north side of the home as required by the
Building Official to meet the 2021 IRC table R302.1(1) requirement. Vote
4-0.
Adjournment
The next meeting will held on July 11, 2024.
There being no further business Chairman Caughey adjourned the meeting at 5:15 p.m.
CERTIFICATION
True and correct copy of the Minutes of the Proceedings for Thursday June 27,
2024.
